@startuml
left to right direction
actor Student
actor Administrator
rectangle "Smart Campus System" {
  usecase "View availability" as ViewAvailability
  usecase "Book room" as BookRoom
  usecase "Cancel booking" as CancelBooking
  usecase "Block or unblock room" as BlockRoom
  usecase "Review usage" as ReviewUsage
  usecase "Send confirmation" as SendConfirmation
}
Student --> ViewAvailability
Student --> BookRoom
Student --> CancelBooking
Student --> ReviewUsage
Student --> SendConfirmation
Administrator --> BlockRoom
Administrator --> ReviewUsage
note bottom of BookRoom
Assumptions:
- Touching bookings do not overlap.
- Blocking keeps existing bookings.
end note
@enduml
